    <bpmn:process id="W_W331" name="W331. IT General Controls (ITGC) &amp; Cybersecurity Audit" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved Audit Plan (W120) or significant IT change (e.g., ERP migration)
Frequency: Annual
Volume: 1 comprehensive IT audit per year
Owner: IT Auditor / Head of IA
Participants: IT Operations, Information Security, CIO, Business Process Owners
Source: workflow W331 — IT General Controls (ITGC) &amp; Cybersecurity Audit</bpmn:documentation>
