Responsible (R): IT Auditor
Accountable (A): Head of IA
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W331_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W331_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
