Responsible (R): IT Auditor
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W331_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W331_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
