Responsible (R): IT Auditor
Accountable (A): BPO
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W338_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W338_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
