Responsible (R): IT Admin
Accountable (A): IT Manager
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W338_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W338_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W338_Task13" name="Document mitigating controls for accepted risks (e.g., dual-auth on high-value…">
