Responsible (R): BPO
Accountable (A): IT Auditor
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W338_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W338_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
