        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-304 (ensure controlled execution — Audit Planning &amp; Execution (PA-21.1).) | - operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Internal Audit / Fixed Asset Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
